title: LiamAndOscar
---
<<declare $LiamAndOscar_interaction_times = 0>>
<<declare $LiamAndOscar_fun = false>>
<<declare $LiamAndOscar_ducks = false>>

<<if $LiamAndOscar_interaction_times == 0>>
  You: Hey, guys.
  Oscar: Hey. Hi. Oh my god. The world is ending. The world is ending.
  You: Uhh, is he okay?
  Liam: Not... really?
  Oscar: Okay? Nothing is okay! The world is ending and I haven't even done everything yet!
  Liam: Chill out, man! You don't need to do everything. Just have some fun! Let's sing a song!
  Oscar: Liam, we don't have time for songs. We gotta spend these last five minutes RIGHT.
  -> I think you guys should just have fun.
    Oscar: ...You really think so?
    You: Yeah. There's only so much time left. Don't spend it worrying!
    Liam: Heck yeah! Listen to this beat, Oscar. It's super super good!
    Liam: <i>Starts beatboxing.</i>
    Oscar: <i>Tentatively joins beatboxing.</i>
    Oscar: I guess this is pretty fun...
    You: I think this will be a really good song. Good luck!
    <<set $LiamAndOscar_fun = true>>
  -> I think you guys should try to find meaning before the end.
    Liam: Okay. But how would we do that?
    You: Talk to your family and friends. Think about the things you love.
    You: There's meaning all around you. Don't worry too much about the perfect end.
    Oscar: Hmm... You know, growing up my friends and I always ran around playing silly games.
    Oscar: We used to pretend we were ducks. I really miss being so carefree.
    Liam: We can be ducks now! QUACK! Come on, give it a try!
    Oscar: Quack.
    Liam: You gotta put more gusto behind it. QUACK!
    Oscar: QUACK!
    You: Have fun being ducks, guys!
    Liam: QUACK!
    <<set $LiamAndOscar_ducks = true>>
  <<set $LiamAndOscar_interaction_times = 1>>
<<elseif $LiamAndOscar_interaction_times == 1>>
  <<if $LiamAndOscar_fun>>
    Liam: Hey, do you want to hear the song we wrote?
    -> Of course!
    -> Um... maybe not.
      Liam: Come on, man! Don't be such a downer.
    Oscar: Here we go! 5, 6! 5, 6, 7, 8!
    Liam: Time monster blows away!
    Oscar: Marshmallows eat someone today!
    You: Wow... That sounds... great...
  <<elseif $LiamAndOscar_ducks>>
    Oscar: QUACK QUACK QUACK!
    Liam: QUACK QUACK QUACK!
    You: Hey, guys. How's the meaning finding going?
    Liam: Oh, I completely forgot about that.
    Oscar: Yeah, me too. But I think we were able to reconnect with our sense of childhood wonder.
    You: That's great to hear!
    Liam: Yep! It's super super good! QUACK!
    Oscar: QUACK!
    You: QUACK!
  <<endif>>
  <<set $LiamAndOscar_interaction_times += 1>>
<<else>>
  <<if $LiamAndOscar_fun>>
    Liam: Time monster blows away!
    Oscar: Marshmallows eat someone today!
  <<elseif $LiamAndOscar_ducks>>
    Oscar: QUACK QUACK QUACK!
    Liam: QUACK QUACK QUACK!
  <<endif>>
<<endif>>

===
